<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Gaja!</font>

73
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:28,670
<font face="Segoe UI" size="24">Rill! Đoàn trưởng Charlotte!</font>

74
00:06:28,670 --> 00:06:30,740
